            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to the use of 2-chloro-2'-deoxyadenosine, hereinafter referred to as cladribine, or a pharmaceutically acceptable salt thereof, for treating or ameliorating an autoimmune, neuromuscular disorder, e.g. the autoimmune neuromuscular disorder myasthenia gravis (MG).</p>
